@FixNear_HostAddress = http://localhost:5232
@token = paste-jwt-token-here

### Get categories
GET {{FixNear_HostAddress}}/api/Categories
Accept: application/json

### Get providers (optional filters: ?category=Plumber&area=Tirur)
GET {{FixNear_HostAddress}}/api/Providers
Accept: application/json

### Get provider by id
GET {{FixNear_HostAddress}}/api/Providers/1
Accept: application/json

### Get provider reviews
GET {{FixNear_HostAddress}}/api/Providers/1/reviews
Accept: application/json

### Register
POST {{FixNear_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test2@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Customer"
}

### Login
POST {{FixNear_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### My bookings (requires token)
GET {{FixNear_HostAddress}}/api/Bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create booking (requires token)
POST {{FixNear_HostAddress}}/api/Bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerId": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-01",
  "address": "My Home, Tirur",
  "problem": "Fan not working"
}

### Cancel booking (requires token)
PUT {{FixNear_HostAddress}}/api/Bookings/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
